msgid "绑定码可稍后再填，也可以注册后继续添加孩子。"
msgstr "You can fill in the bind code later, or keep adding children after registering."

msgid "角色"
msgstr "Role"

msgid "请输入老师提供的孩子绑定码。"
msgstr "Enter the child bind code provided by your teacher."

msgid "请选择注册身份"
msgstr "Choose who you are registering as"

msgid "账号审批与教师邀请码"
msgstr "Account approvals & teacher invite codes"

msgid "返回登录"
msgstr "Back to sign in"

msgid "还没有学生"
msgstr "No students yet"

msgid "还没有账号？注册家长账号"
msgstr "No account yet? Register a parent account"

msgid "还没有邀请码"
msgstr "No invite codes yet"

msgid "邀请码"
msgstr "Invite code"

msgid "邮箱"
msgstr "Email"

msgid "降为教师"
msgstr "Demote to teacher"

msgid "需要学校邀请码，提交后等待管理者审核"
msgstr "Requires a school invite code; wait for a manager to approve after you submit"

msgid "Excel 批量导入教师"
msgstr "Bulk import teachers from Excel"

msgid "仅管理者可用。每行一位教师，只需填姓名；用户名即姓名，与已有账号重名时自动加数字后缀（如 王小明2）。"
msgstr "Managers only. One teacher per row; fill in the name only. The username equals the name, and a numeric suffix is added automatically on duplicates (e.g. 王小明2)."

msgid "初始密码统一为 %(pw)s，教师登录后可在“修改密码”自行更改。"
msgstr "The initial password is %(pw)s for everyone; teachers can change it under 'Change password' after signing in."

msgid "成功创建以下教师账号："
msgstr "Successfully created these teacher accounts:"

msgid "教师导入"
msgstr "Import teachers"

msgid "教师姓名过长"
msgstr "Teacher name is too long"

msgid "修改密码"
msgstr "Change password"

msgid "修改你自己的登录密码，保存后不会退出登录。"
msgstr "Change your own sign-in password. You stay signed in after saving."

msgid "当前密码"
msgstr "Current password"

msgid "新密码（至少 8 位）"
msgstr "New password (at least 8 characters)"

msgid "再次输入新密码"
msgstr "Re-enter new password"

msgid "保存新密码"
msgstr "Save new password"

msgid "返回工作台"
msgstr "Back to dashboard"

msgid "修改家长密码"
msgstr "Change parent password"

msgid "用于「学生姓名 + 家长密码」登录；初始密码由学校统一设置，建议尽快修改。"
msgstr "Used for student-name plus parent-password sign-in; the initial password is set by the school, so please change it soon."

msgid "当前家长密码"
msgstr "Current parent password"

msgid "新密码（至少 6 位）"
msgstr "New password (at least 6 characters)"

msgid "用家长账号（用户名或邮箱），或孩子的姓名/学号 + 家长密码登录。"
msgstr "Sign in with a parent account (username or email), or with your child's name/Student ID plus the parent password."

msgid "用户名 / 邮箱 / 孩子姓名或学号"
msgstr "Username / email / child's name or Student ID"

msgid "学号：必填且全局唯一，学生用“学号 + 密码”登录；学号已存在则更新该学生"
msgstr "Student ID: required and globally unique; students sign in with their Student ID and password. An existing ID updates that student."

msgid "中文姓名：必填；与已有学生重名时自动加数字后缀（如 张三2），因此姓名也可作为登录名"
msgstr "Chinese name: required; if it duplicates an existing student, a numeric suffix is added automatically (e.g. 张三2), so the name can also be used to sign in"

msgid "密码：学生的登录密码，必填"
msgstr "Password: the student's sign-in password, required"

msgid "教师用户名：必须已存在且为本校在职老师；班级不存在时自动创建并归给该老师，一个老师可管理多个班"
msgstr "Teacher username: must exist and be an active teacher at this school; the class is created and assigned to that teacher if missing, and one teacher can manage multiple classes"

msgid "家长登录：用“学生姓名 + 家长密码”，初始家长密码统一为 %(pw)s，家长登录后可自行修改"
msgstr "Parent sign-in: use the student name plus the parent password; the initial parent password is %(pw)s for everyone, and parents can change it after signing in"

msgid "缺少学号"
msgstr "Missing student ID"

msgid "学号不能超过 24 个字符"
msgstr "Student ID cannot exceed 24 characters"

msgid "学号 %s 在表格中重复"
msgstr "Student ID %s is duplicated in the sheet"

msgid "缺少学生密码"
msgstr "Missing student password"
